H("886.d.7.D",3,"A planner uses a digital map layer and satellite positioning to find the closest depot to a customer. She is using:","Geographic Information Systems and Global Positioning Systems",["a paper atlas only","a guess","a compass only"],"GIS and GPS.")
H("886.d.7.D",4,"A benefit of GIS to a distributor is that it can:","map delivery points and analyze the best routes",["draw cartoons","print tickets","paint trucks"],"GIS benefit.")
H("886.d.7.E",3,"A warehouse manager uses software to schedule shifts and track the forklifts and racks the company owns. She is using:","computer-based equipment to manage human resources and physical assets",["a notebook only","no software","only memory"],"Manage assets.")
H("886.d.7.E",4,"Tracking physical assets in software helps a company:","know where equipment is and when it needs service",["lose equipment","avoid maintenance","hide costs"],"Asset tracking.")
H("886.d.7.F",3,"A receiving clerk scans each carton's barcode into the system so the item is counted and located. She is using:","technology applications such as barcode systems to identify and track goods",["handwriting only","guessing","no tracking"],"Barcode tracking.")
H("886.d.7.F",4,"A barcode scanner speeds up receiving because it:","reads item data instantly and reduces typing errors",["slows counting","adds errors","blocks tracking"],"Barcode speed.")
H("886.d.7.G",3,"A customer opens a phone app to watch a delivery truck move along the map toward their address. This is:","using mobile applications such as GPS to track goods and shipments",["guessing arrival","no tracking","mailing a letter"],"Mobile tracking.")
