H("886.d.8.A",3,"A manager notices that pickers walk far between items and uses the pick-time data to find the slowest area of the warehouse. She is:","using data to identify areas of operation that need improvement",["ignoring data","guessing","blaming workers"],"Data shows slow spots.")
