H("886.d.8.B",3,"After studying the slow aisle, a team proposes slotting fast-moving items near the dock and batching orders. They are:","identifying alternative processes and procedures to improve and optimize business operations",["making no changes","copying old methods","ignoring options"],"Alternatives.")
