H("886.d.9.A",4,"The best order for dealing with a hazard is to:","identify it, assess the risk and then control it",["ignore it","wait for injury","only post a sign later"],"Identify, assess, control.")
H("886.d.9.B",3,"A trainer reviews each part of the company safety program and explains why each part, such as training and hazard reporting, matters. She is:","stating the role and summarizing the benefits of each component in a health, safety and environmental management system",["no role","no benefits","only one part"],"Safety system.")
H("886.d.9.B",4,"One benefit of a safety and health management system is that it:","reduces injuries and costs over time",["raises injuries","hides risk","adds accidents"],"System benefits.")
H("886.d.9.C",3,"A warehouse team practices what to do when a pallet of chemicals leaks, including who calls for help and where to meet. They are:","demonstrating emergency procedures to reduce and mitigate workplace accidents",["ignoring emergencies","panicking","skipping drills"],"Emergency drills.")
H("886.d.9.C",4,"During a spill emergency, workers should first:","get to safety and alert the response team",["clean it bare-handed","ignore it","spread it around"],"Safety first.")
H("886.d.9.D",3,"A safety lead inspects the ladders, the pallet jacks and the gloves in the supply room and logs what she finds. She is:","performing tool, equipment, facility and personal protective equipment audits and inspections",["avoiding audits","skipping tools","ignoring PPE"],"Audits.")
