H("886.d.9.E",3,"A trainee reads about OSHA rules that require guarding, training and hazard communication. She is:","identifying rules and laws designed to promote safety and health in the workplace",["ignoring laws","breaking rules","avoiding rules"],"Safety laws.")
H("886.d.9.E",4,"The U.S. agency that sets and enforces workplace safety standards is:","OSHA",["the IRS","NASA","the FCC"],"OSHA role.")
H("886.d.9.F",3,"A trainee practices chest compressions on a mannequin and learns how to treat a cut with a bandage. She is demonstrating:","knowledge of first aid and cardiopulmonary resuscitation procedures",["no first aid","avoiding emergencies","ignoring injured people"],"First aid and CPR.")
H("886.d.9.F",4,"When someone collapses and isn't breathing, the first steps are to:","call emergency services and start CPR",["walk away","wait","give a drink"],"Act quickly.")
